Intraday Alpha Platform — third-party notices
=============================================

The platform's own source code is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). That statement
covers the code in this repository only. The build, the test suites and the
container images pull in third-party software under its own terms; this file
records what and under which licence, so a reader knows what they are
redistributing when they publish an image built from this tree.

Nothing here is vendored into the repository: every entry is fetched by the
toolchain (apt / crates.io / pip / a container registry) at build time. The
pins live in `docs/BUILD_NOTES.md`, `rust/Cargo.lock`, `python/pyproject.toml`
and `deployment/docker/*`; `docs/governance/SECURITY.md` §1 governs additions.


